OL,3,GNEWSAMum critical of delays to ADHD and
OL,4,Aautism assessments
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome parents have been told they face
OL,7,Fdelays to assessments for autism and
OL,8,FADHD diagnoses in Northamptonshire.
OL,10,FVictoria McConnachie from Gayton said
OL,11,Fher daughter Alba, nine, has been on
OL,12,Fthe NHS waiting list for an assessment
OL,13,Fsince 2023, and earlier this year the
OL,14,Ffamily applied to the NHS who agreed to
OL,15,Ffund a private assessment.
OL,17,FHowever, last month the mum was told by
OL,18,Fthe provider that the county's NHS
OL,19,FIntegrated Care Board (ICB) had set
OL,20,Flimits and assessments were on hold.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
