OL,3,GNEWSAMum critical of delays to ADHD and
OL,4,Aautism assessments
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Northamptonshire ICB
OL,7,Fsaid demand for assessments and
OL,8,Ftreatment had "increased significantly
OL,9,Fin recent years, creating considerable
OL,10,Fpressure on NHS services nationally and
OL,11,Facross Northamptonshire".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
